  message: "Merged in PR #2108. React component linker creates renders_component edges from JSX usage to component definitions. 40 tests, 100% coverage. Addresses Gap 2 (component composition) which was the highest-impact gap. Gaps 1 (ReactDOM entrypoints) and 3 (React Router routes) remain but are lower priority."  # c282
